[
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あ、プロデューサーさんっ！\r\nあたしの結果、どうでしたかっ！？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "009",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "000",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900107/7009001070010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やったぞ、果穂！\r\n『W.I.N.G.』への出場が決まったんだ！",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "～～～っ！　やった～！　\r\nやっと、ここまで来ましたっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900107/7009001070020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、あと少しで、ヒーローの心を持つ、\r\n新しいアイドルの誕生だ！",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ、プロデューサーさんのおかげです\r\nありがとうございます！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900107/7009001070030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……本当に成長したな、果穂\r\n果穂と初めて会った日が、ずいぶん昔みたいに感じるよ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへっ！　最初に比べると、\r\nあたしも、ずっと強くなった気がしますっ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900107/7009001070040"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "最近アイドルのお仕事をしてると、\r\nあたしもヒーローに近づいてきたなあ、って思うんですっ！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900107/7009001070050"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "みんなから応援されて、みんなを笑顔にしてっ！\r\n困難にも、立ち向かい続けて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900107/7009001070060"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そして最後には、必ず勝利するんですっ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900107/7009001070070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うんうん\r\n最近の果穂は、本当に頼もしくなったな",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへっ！　本当ですかっ？\r\nプロデューサーさんに褒められちゃいましたっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900107/7009001070080"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "アイドルとしてパワーアップしてるってことですね！\r\nとぉーっ！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900107/7009001070090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……おっ、アイドルになり立てだった頃とは\r\n動きのキレが全然違うな！",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ！　あたし、今ならどんな怪人が出てきても\r\n倒せる気がしますっ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900107/7009001070100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは。……でも俺は、果穂がまだまだ\r\nパワーアップできると思ってるんだ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、これからも一緒に頑張ろうな！",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　よろしくお願いしますっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900107/7009001070110"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたし、アイドルとしてもっと強くなりますからっ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900107/7009001070120"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]